# jurassic_park_the_pin 1.05 - worked out by the app from the ports of The Beatles 1.29, Deadpool LE 1.14, Deadpool Pro 1.16, Godzilla Premium/LE 1.16, Godzilla Pro 1.15, Jaws LE 1.02, TMNT Pro 1.59.
# Emulator-proven 2026-09-25 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, item 162): the
# runtime hooked the game, 29 of its 32 shots came from their switches, a drain ended each ball, and
# the 6 events below fired where their names say (three balls to the game's end).
# Shots no press made (their switch is left out of the check, or needs two): Shot 0x20000, Shot 0x40000000, Shot 0x200000000.
# program sha1 2edcffd1f0383289f1635c98f25c0d5fe06b7655, portgen revision 3, 7 reference port(s) of framework generation B.
# 29 shot(s) the app could not name are named after the switch that made them in the check.

game           jurassic_park_the_pin
version        1.05

